     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Register depends on context",
     "texto": [
      "Keep the purpose and change the greeting, the degree of explicitness and the closing depending on the relationship and channel. Don't confuse formality with unnecessary distance. In a formal request, identify the matter and the action; with a friend you can be more direct without losing politeness."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
